  "dbt3wNote": "DBT3W: analyzers, analyzers-dbt, lineage-core and project-contracts packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from green Common main 2622064 (the REPIN5 pin); semantic-core and analysis-protocol are byte-identical there. host-node and compat-v3 keep their earlier pins.",
  "caproute1bNote": "CAPROUTE1b: tool-catalog and capability-router packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from Common 6b87493 (!138); semantic-core alpha.4 is byte-identical there and keeps its pin.",
  "navsvc1Note": "NAVSVC1: view-spi pinned to Common main 55c4412a (!157 merged; re-pack from 55c4412a gives the same sha256 as the earlier 46563fb pack); arch-catalog, arch-decisions and decision-rationale packed in the same run, their sources are identical to Common main 5794003. lineage-core alpha.1 and semantic-core alpha.4 keep their pins.",
  "tbx1cNote": "TBX1c: tool-catalog 0.1.0-alpha.2 (typed sideEffectKinds, Workspace Monitoring, owns TOOL_SIDE_EFFECTS) and capability-router re-packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from Common main 5794003 (supersedes the CAPROUTE1b 6b87493 pins; both from one Common commit, byte-identical to the dd950b2 pack).",
  "sourceDirty": false,
  "repin5Note": "REPIN5 (TL-13): all vendored Common packages re-packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from merged V5FREEZE1 a6b7ad332d206b95867e795ff896350827518bfc. analyzers-api vendored for OTEL2, not wired. Versions: semantic-core@0.1.0-alpha.4, analysis-protocol@0.1.0-alpha.4, compat-v3@0.1.0-alpha.3, tool-catalog@0.1.0-alpha.3, capability-router@0.1.0-alpha.2, project-contracts@0.1.0-alpha.5, lineage-core@0.1.0-alpha.3, view-spi@0.1.0-alpha.3, analyzers@0.1.0-alpha.9, analyzers-dbt@0.1.0-alpha.3, analyzers-api@0.1.0-alpha.3, arch-decisions@0.1.0-alpha.3, arch-catalog@0.1.0-alpha.3, decision-rationale@0.1.0-alpha.3, analysis-host-node@0.1.0-alpha.6.",
  "repin8Note": "REPIN8 (ARCH-REVIEW S1): all vendored Common packages re-packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from merged V5FREEZE2 ae07f9e; exchange-protocol added to the vendored set. Versions: semantic-core@0.1.0-alpha.4, analysis-protocol@0.1.0-alpha.4, exchange-protocol@0.1.0-alpha.6, compat-v3@0.1.0-alpha.3, tool-catalog@0.1.0-alpha.3, capability-router@0.1.0-alpha.2, project-contracts@0.1.0-alpha.6, lineage-core@0.1.0-alpha.4, view-spi@0.1.0-alpha.4, analyzers@0.1.0-alpha.10, analyzers-dbt@0.1.0-alpha.4, analyzers-api@0.1.0-alpha.4, arch-decisions@0.1.0-alpha.4, arch-catalog@0.1.0-alpha.4, decision-rationale@0.1.0-alpha.4, analysis-host-node@0.1.0-alpha.7.",
  "stda1aNote": "STDA1a (PM 31 TL-13 ruling, re-vendored at merge with main REPIN8): analyzers-airflow and analyzers-orchestration packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from V5FREEZE2 ae07f9e81e588cc9bfeb563b6ebf96e000838491; their Common deps re-pack byte-identical to the REPIN8 pins, no other package changed. Versions: analyzers-airflow@0.1.0-alpha.6, analyzers-orchestration@0.1.0-alpha.6.",
  "navchg1Note": "NAVCHG1 (re-vendored at merge with main REPIN8): semantic-diff packed with scripts/pack-vendor.mjs from V5FREEZE2 ae07f9e81e588cc9bfeb563b6ebf96e000838491 (replaces alpha.3 from d6770bf, which pinned project-contracts alpha.3); its Common deps re-pack byte-identical to the REPIN8 pins. Version: semantic-diff@0.1.0-alpha.6."
}
